    {
      "text": "武器会在竞技场墙面间自动弹射并击杀敌人，不同武器拥有不同战斗方式。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "An incremental arena where your weapons do the fighting. Bounce off walls, hit enemies, collect loot, get stronger. Multiple Weapons: Archers, Daggers, Swords, Bazookas, and more. Each one plays different.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4389400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "大型技能树不仅提升数值，还会解锁武器与整套系统，每个节点都改变玩法。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Massive Skill Tree: Unlock new weapons, boost your stats, enable entire systems. Every node changes how you play.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4389400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "连续快速击杀会触发 Rage，让竞技场生成更多敌人、混乱和掉落，形成风险收益加速。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Rage System: Kill fast enough and the arena fights back. More enemies, more chaos, more loot.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4389400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
